      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    unlevered_firm_value = 800_000\n    debt = 300_000\n    interest_rate = 0.05\n    tax_rate = 0.28\n    periods = 5\n\n    # Calculate the present value of the interest tax shield\n    annual_tax_shield = debt * interest_rate * tax_rate\n    pv_tax_shield = annual_tax_shield * (\n        1 - (1 / (1 + interest_rate) ** periods)\n    ) / interest_rate\n\n    # Calculate APV\n    apv = unlevered_firm_value + pv_tax_shield\n\n    # Return APV rounded to the nearest integer\n    return round(apv)\n```",
